PE 814: Mezzo-forte / 中强音

=== Problem Summary ===
4n people in a circle, each looks left/right/opposite.
S(n) = #ways exactly 2n people scream (n mutual pairs).

=== Verify S(1) = 48 ===
  S(1) = 48 (expected 48) ✓

=== Analytical verification for n=1 ===
  4 people: positions 0,1,2,3
  Possible pairs: (0,2), (1,3) [opposite]
                  (0,1), (1,2), (2,3), (3,0) [adjacent]
  Total: 6 possible pairs × 8 configs for others = 48 ✓

=== PE Answer ===
  S(1000) mod 998244353 = 307159326
